<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V AUSTRALIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V AUSTRALIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the second day</p>
<p>of the third and final test between South Africa and Australia</p>
<p>at Centurion Park on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scoreboard:</p>
<p>Australia first innings: 227 (Steve Waugh 67, Brett Schultz</p>
<p>4-52)</p>
<p>South Africa first innings:</p>
<p> G.Kirsten c Healy b McGrath		16</p>
<p> A.Bacher not out			     94</p>
<p> B.McMillan c Hayden b M.Waugh	    55</p>
<p> D.Cullinan b McGrath			 47</p>
<p> P.Symcox not out				5</p>
<p> Extras (b-4 lb-13 w-1 nb-5)		23		   </p>
<p> Total (three wickets, 90 overs)	 240</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-26 2-128 3-229</p>
<p>To bat: Hansie Cronje (captain), Jacques Kallis, Dave</p>
<p>Richardson, Lance Klusener, Brett Schultz, Allan Donald.</p>
<p>Bowling: McGrath 24-7-46-2, Gillespie 18-8-38-0 (1w),</p>
<p>Blewett 5-0-19-0 (1nb), Warne 24-9-47-0 (4nb), Bevan 12-3-39-0,</p>
<p>M.Waugh 7-1-34-1</p>
</text>
